      "value": "@{63691297469f06772579fe6f|full_name} I was able to fix the issue by removing a particle system prefab that came from the Unity Particle Pack (“Big Explosion”) which I had unpacked and modified to remove a point light and change many parameters (mostly turning things off, changing sizes, didn’t add any features). I assume that the presence of this particular particle system, even after removing all lights from it (verified all particle-lights and other light sources were removed) may have contributed to the cause. It may be one of the materials that comes with it?",
